        "q_brand1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "1. What is the brand all about?",
            "answer": "<p>Heitz is a design-led lighting brand built on one simple belief: light should do more than brighten a room — it should bring warmth, balance, and calm into everyday spaces. Inspired by Scandinavian simplicity and Japandi balance, we curate every piece against the same standard — clean form, honest materials, and a soft, considered glow — choosing only lighting we'd happily live with ourselves.</p><p>We'd rather offer one light that's right than ten that are loud — pieces that feel timeless, intentional, and at home for years to come. <a href=\"/pages/brand-story\" title=\"Brand Story\">Discover our full story.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "q_brand2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "2. Where are you based?",
            "answer": "<p>We are based in the <strong>United States</strong> and currently serve customers across the <strong>USA and UK</strong>. As we continue to grow, we’re looking forward to expanding into more regions soon.</p>"
