          "settings": {
            "question": "3. What makes your lighting different?",
            "answer": "<p>Our collections are selected with a clear design direction — clean forms, soft glow, natural warmth, and pieces that feel easy to live with. Before anything joins our collection, we experience it ourselves — testing the light and living with each piece — so we only offer lighting we'd genuinely choose for our own homes. The goal is to enhance a room without overpowering it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_brand4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "4. What design style inspires your products?",
            "answer": "<p>Our style is inspired by <strong>Scandinavian simplicity</strong> and <strong>Japandi balance</strong> — minimal forms, warm materials, calm spaces, and intentional design choices that feel timeless rather than trend-focused.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_brand5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "5. Are your products suitable for different rooms?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our lighting is selected for everyday spaces such as living rooms, dining areas, bedrooms, kitchens, bathrooms, and quiet corners of the home. Each piece is chosen to support both function and atmosphere. If you'd like help choosing the right piece for a specific space, our support team is always happy to offer personalized guidance — <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">just reach out.</a></p>"
          }
        },
