            "answer": "<p>We offer a <strong>30-day return policy</strong>. If you’re not completely satisfied with your order, you can contact us within 30 days of receiving your item, and we’ll guide you through the return process.</p><p>To be eligible for a return, the item should be unused, in its original condition, and returned with its original packaging where possible. Find more information <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">here.</a></p>"
